{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":20690054,"name":"nulnvoid","username":"nulnvoid-47202","avatar_template":"/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png","created_at":"2023-05-24T06:23:05.120Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ePet Battle against Delver Mardai in Zaralek Cavern.  When fighting Tempe, if it has Heat Up applied and my pet dies to it, Tempe will still cast Magma Wave even though I have no current active front-line pet.  Although dead, my front-line pet still scored hits with Swarm after dying to Tempe’s Heat Up shield damage.  This happened during two separate battles.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattle log shows:\u003cbr\u003e\n[Heat Up] dealt 211 damage to your Chitterspine Skitterling.\u003cbr\u003e\nYour Chitterspine Skitterling died.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Swarm] dealt 238 damage to enemy Tempe.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Swarm] dealt 238 damage to enemy Tempe.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Swarm] applied [Shattered Defenses] to enemy Tempe.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Magma Wave] dealt 147 damage to your Slimy Hermit Crab.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Magma Wave] dealt 147 damage to your Ghostshell Crab.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo add to this using all mechanical pets:\u003cbr\u003e\nMotorized Croaker used Explode to kill Tempe.\u003cbr\u003e\nFailsafe activated, then Explode went off again, killing the Motorized Croaker again.  Never seen this before, as when I have used Explode in other pet battles, my mechanical pet just dies, it doesn’t activate the Failsafe then die a second time.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2023-05-24T06:31:12.100Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":5.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":1597497,"topic_slug":"bug-delver-mardai-pet-attack-issue","display_username":"nulnvoid","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":fal